        ],
        "en": [
          "An opportunity to discover a city which, destroyed in the nine-tenths during the fire of June 1940, still has rich testimonies of its past such as the highest Gothic choir in the world or the former bishop's palace now transformed into a museum.\n\nThe main circuit is accessible, as a whole, to people with reduced mobility."
